  category: 3
  lines:
  - text: They say the planet Dessert has a special chocolate mineral.
    weight: 2
  - text: I can't wait to see what other plates you will come up with.
    weight: 0
  - text: They say the stream close by has great salmon.
    weight: 0
  - text: Sometimes the forest can get scary at night.
    weight: 0
  - text: I like to look to the sky and wonder what life on the other planets must
      be like.
    weight: 0
